{"id": "34565", "title": "安妮宝贝文集", "author": "安妮宝贝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 22, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34565.htm", "intro": "安妮宝贝，自由作家。98年开始发表小说，因作品风格独特引起广泛关注。題材多围绕宿命，自由，漂泊等命题思考，创作工业化大城市中游离者的生活，他们在爱和幻觉中的决然出行,及对自我的追寻。\r\n\r\n从事过的职业：金融、广告、编辑\r\n现在的职业：网络编辑，自由专栏撰稿和写作者\r\n喜欢：爱尔兰音乐，长途旅行，鸢尾，电影，散步\r\n\r\n2000年起出版小说集《告别薇安》，《八月未央》，长篇小说《彼岸花》。所有作品均持续登上书店系统销售排行榜,并进入全国文艺类书籍畅销排行榜前十名。作品在众多读者中深具影响。并已介入香港，台湾，日本，德国等地区。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34565", "chapters": [{"title": "最后约期", "file": "2193795.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七年", "file": "2193796.html", "available": false}, {"title": "下坠", "file": "2193797.html", "available": false}, {"title": "午夜飞行", "file": "2193798.html", "available": false}, {"title": "上海冬天", "file": "2193799.html", "available": false}, {"title": "空城", "file": "2193800.html", "available": false}, {"title": "空城", "file": "2193801.html", "available": false}, {"title": "生命是幻觉", "file": "2193802.html", "available": false}, {"title": "呼吸", "file": "2193803.html", "available": false}, {"title": "告别薇安", "file": "2193804.html", "available": false}, {"title": "瓶中信", "file": "2193805.html", "available": false}, {"title": "为你心动", "file": "2193806.html", "available": false}, {"title": "爱已如风", "file": "2193807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "沧海蝴蝶", "file": "2193808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我读亦舒", "file": "2193809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "瞬间空白", "file": "2193810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "彼岸花", "file": "2193811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "安妮走四方", "volume": true}, {"title": "前言", "file": "2193813.html", "available": false}, {"title": "南京", "file": "2193814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "武汉", "file": "2193815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "大连", "file": "2193816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "西安", "file": "2193818.html", "available": false}]}